Package: fedstats
Type: Package
Title: Federated Statistics for Multi-Registry Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Victor Staartjes Lab", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "fedstats@example.com")
Description: Coordinator-side functions for privacy-preserving federated
    analyses across hospital registries. Site servers expose only aggregate
    statistics via HTTP (plumber); this package provides the client
    functions for collecting and combining those aggregates without moving
    individual patient data. Includes in-process site simulation, remote
    HTTP clients, federated linear and logistic regression, descriptive
    statistics, cross-site heterogeneity checks, and an output-registration
    system for building generic analysis scripts.
